( Expected-error test for element_beam_direction_z, manual Professional
  6.415. The local z direction (1,0,1) of the beam along x is not
  perpendicular to the beam length direction. Professional 02-08-2026
  stops with "Error, ELEMENT_BEAM_DIRECTION_Z should be perpendicular to
  the beam length direction."; GNU stops with the same text.
  EXPECTED_ERROR: ELEMENT_BEAM_DIRECTION_Z should be perpendicular to the beam length direction )

echo -no
number_of_space_dimensions 3
materi_velocity
materi_displacement
beam_rotation
end_initia
node 1 0 0 0
node 2 1 0 0
element 1 -beam 1 2
element_beam_direction_z 1 1 0 1
group_type 0 -beam
group_beam_young 0 1
group_beam_shear 0 1
group_beam_inertia 0 1 4 1
bounda_dof 0 1 -velx -vely -velz -rotx -roty -rotz
bounda_force 1 2 -vely
bounda_time 1 0.01
control_timestep 0 1. 1.
end_data
